            "markdown": "**오늘의 흐름**\n\nTARGET → VALUE PROPOSITION → ECP → FUTURE ICP HYPOTHESIS → ANTI-ICP BOUNDARY",
            "emphasis": "normal"
          },
          "theme": { "background": "muted", "bordered": true },
